    Middle Floors,           !- Name
    Mid Floor List,          !- Zone List Name
    2;                       !- Zone List Multiplier

!-   ===========  ALL OBJECTS IN CLASS: SURFACEGEOMETRY ===========

  GlobalGeometryRules,
    LowerLeftCorner,         !- Starting Vertex Position
    Clockwise,               !- Vertex Entry Direction
    Relative;                !- Coordinate System

